f size d*1 ,' with X in #2F2FD0, 'Vector' bold #111111, 'd*1' in #E05A7A; 'G is a Matrix of size m*d ,' with G in #D81B4A, 'Matrix' bold #111111, 'm*d' in #E05A7A; 'h is a Vector of size m*1' with h in #2F2FD0, 'Vector' bold #111111, 'm*1' in #E05A7A.\n13. Draw panel 3 rectangle at box [0.065,0.718,0.862,0.922], border #B11F42, fill #FBFAFB.\n14. Place left-aligned heading 'Put all Equal \"=\" constraints in the form:' at box [0.083,0.741,0.413,0.777], color #B01E45, bold italic underlined, ~17 pt.\n15. Place equation 'A x = b' at box [0.083,0.783,0.160,0.848], ~22 pt: A in #D81B4A, x in #2F2FD0, = in #111111, b in #2F2FD0.\n16. In panel 3 right side at box [0.290,0.772,0.548,0.866], place 'where:' label in #B01E45 bold ~15 pt, then four definition lines ~15 pt: 'm is Number of constraints ,' with m in #2E9E4F, 'Number' bold #111111; 'X is a Vector of size d*1 ,' with X in #2F2FD0, 'Vector' bold #111111, 'd*1' in #E05A7A; 'A is a Matrix of size m*d ,' with A in #D81B4A, 'Matrix' bold #111111, 'm*d' in #E05A7A; 'b is a Vector of size m*1' with b in #2F2FD0, 'Vector' bold #111111, 'm*1' in #E05A7A.\n17. Draw solid black rectangle band at box [0.0,0.929,1.0,1.0], fill #000000 (capture-only video letterbox [?]).",
