    "recreation_brief": "1. Create a 960x540 px white slide. Draw the outer frame rectangle at [0.062,0.077,0.933,0.945] with fill #F2F2F2 and 1 px border #C00000.\n2. Add centered title text 'Less Than Equal Constraints' in box [0.328,0.118,0.719,0.176], Calibri bold ~32 pt, color #C00000.\n3. Add badge shape at [0.888,0.091,0.934,0.185]: rounded rectangle/circle, fill #FFFF00, outline #7030A0, containing text '6' in black bold ~14 pt.\n4. Draw row 1 container rectangle at [0.075,0.190,0.900,0.357] with 1 px border #C00000 and no fill.\n5. Inside row 1, place left label '3 constraints' in red #C00000, bold ~14 pt, underlined.\n6. Inside row 1, place constraint line 'x\u2081 \u2264 z\u2081 , x\u2082 \u2264 z\u2082 , x\u2083 \u2264 z\u2083' with x in #FF0000 and z in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n7. Inside row 1, place green right arrow '\u21d2' at [0.433,0.255,0.466,0.296], color #00B050.\n8. Inside row 1, place matrix equation '[[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0,0,1]] \u00b7 [x\u2081,x\u2082,x\u2083] \u2264 [z\u2081,z\u2082,z\u2083]' in box [0.475,0.215,0.67,0.335]; numerals in #000000, x-vector in #FF0000, z-vector in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n9. Inside row 1, place pill at [0.732,0.248,0.834,0.311]: rounded rectangle, fill #FCE4D6, text 'G x \u2264 h' centered, bold ~16 pt, color #C00000.\n10. Draw row 2 container rectangle at [0.075,0.387,0.900,0.580] with 1 px border #C00000 and no fill.\n11. Inside row 2, place constraint line 'x\u2081 \u2265 z\u2081 , x\u2082 \u2265 z\u2082 , x\u2083 \u2265 z\u2083' with x in #FF0000 and z in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n12. Inside row 2, place green right arrow '\u21d2' at [0.433,0.425,0.466,0.47], color #00B050.\n13. Inside row 2, place matrix equation '[[\u22121,0,0],[0,\u22121,0],[0,0,\u22121]] \u00b7 [x\u2081,x\u2082,x\u2083] \u2264 [\u2212z\u2081,\u2212z\u2082,\u2212z\u2083]' in box [0.475,0.388,0.675,0.54]; numerals in #000000, x-vector in #FF0000, \u2212z-vector in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n14. Inside row 2, place Convert note at [0.614,0.396,0.881,0.557]: rounded rectangle, fill #FFF2CC [?], border #BFBFBF [?].\n15. Inside the Convert note, add header 'Convert' in red #C00000, bold, underlined.\n16. Inside the Convert note, add line 'x\u2081 \u2265 z\u2081 , x\u2082 \u2265 z\u2082 , x\u2083 \u2265 z\u2083'.\n17. Inside the Convert note, add text 'to'.\n18. Inside the Convert note, add line '\u2212x\u2081 \u2264 \u2212z\u2081 , \u2212x\u2082 \u2264 \u2212z\u2082 , \u2212x\u2083 \u2264 \u2212z\u2083'.\n19. Draw row 3 container rectangle at [0.075,0.589,0.900,0.913] with 1 px border #C00000 and no fill.\n20. Inside row 3, place left label '6 constraints, 3 variables' in red #C00000, bold ~14 pt, italic, underlined.\n21. Inside row 3, place constraint line 'y\u2081 \u2264 x\u2081 \u2264 z\u2081 , y\u2082 \u2264 x\u2082 \u2264 z\u2082 , y\u2083 \u2264 x\u2083 \u2264 z\u2083' with y in #00B050, x in #FF0000, z in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n22. Inside row 3, place green right arrow '\u21d2' at [0.433,0.700,0.466,0.742], color #00B050.\n23. Inside row 3, place matrix equation '[[\u22121,0,0],[0,\u22121,0],[0,0,\u22121],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0,0,1]] \u00b7 [x\u2081,x\u2082,x\u2083] \u2264 [\u2212y\u2081,\u2212y\u2082,\u2212y\u2083,z\u2081,z\u2082,z\u2083]' in box [0.475,0.595,0.75,0.895]; numerals in #000000, x-vector in #FF0000, \u2212y-vector in #00B050, z-vector in #0070C0, ~14 pt.\n24. Inside row 3, place tag '6 x 3' at [0.558,0.862,0.600,0.898], dark ink, ~9 pt.\n25. Inside row 3, place pill at [0.754,0.697,0.859,0.772]: rounded rectangle, fill #FCE4D6, text 'G x \u2264 h' centered, bold ~16 pt, color #C00000.",
